{"problem":{"stackLimit":128,"modifiedUser":"FrankieFly","judgeCaseMode":"default","auth":1,"description":"一个整数 $a$ 是一个完全平方数，是指它是某一个整数的平方，即存在一个整数 $b$，使得 $a=b^2$。\n给定一个正整数 $n$，请找到最小的正整数 $x$，使得它们的乘积是一个完全平方数。","source":"第十二届蓝桥杯省赛第二场 C++ A组/B组","title":"完全平方数","type":1,"output":"输出找到的最小的正整数 $x$。","ioScore":25,"codeShare":true,"isFileIO":false,"isRemote":false,"timeLimit":1000,"difficulty":0,"input":"输入一行包含一个正整数 $n$。","examples":"<input>12</input><output>3</output><input>15</input><output>15</output>","hint":"对于 $30$% 的评测用例，$1≤n≤1000$，答案不超过 $1000$。\n对于 $60$% 的评测用例，$1≤n≤10^8$，答案不超过 $10^8$。\n对于所有评测用例，$1≤n≤10^{12}$，答案不超过 $10^{12}$。","isRemoveEndBlank":true,"openCaseResult":true,"memoryLimit":256,"problemId":"Q0017","isGroup":false,"isUploadCase":true,"judgeMode":"default"},"languages":["C","C++","Java","Python3"],"samples":[{"output":"1.out","input":"1.in","score":2},{"output":"2.out","input":"2.in","score":2},{"output":"3.out","input":"3.in","score":2},{"output":"4.out","input":"4.in","score":2},{"output":"5.out","input":"5.in","score":2},{"output":"6.out","input":"6.in","score":3},{"output":"7.out","input":"7.in","score":3},{"output":"8.out","input":"8.in","score":3},{"output":"9.out","input":"9.in","score":3},{"output":"10.out","input":"10.in","score":3}],"tags":["数学"],"codeTemplates":[],"judgeMode":"default"}